**3. Relevance of the Image to the PDF Research:**

The image is highly relevant as it is Figure 7D from the 2015 Journal of Controlled Release paper, directly supporting the research. It's a Western blot demonstrating Nano-11's ability to induce the secretion of active IL-1β (identified as 17 kD in the paper, corresponding to the ~15kD band here) from dendritic cells, especially when co-stimulated with LPS. This directly illustrates Nano-11's role in activating dendritic cells and promoting a pro-inflammatory cytokine response, which is a crucial aspect of its adjuvant mechanism as described in the PDF.